REM APPLESOFT BASIC
10 REM HI-RES: THE EIGHT COLOURS, LINES IN ALL DIRECTIONS, HPLOT TO
20 HGR
30 HCOLOR= 3: HPLOT 0,0 TO 279,0 TO 279,159 TO 0,159 TO 0,0
40 FOR C = 0 TO 7: HCOLOR= C: FOR Y = 8 + C * 12 TO 16 + C * 12: HPLOT 10,Y TO 110,Y: NEXT : NEXT
50 HCOLOR= 3: FOR A = 0 TO 6.2 STEP .2: HPLOT 200,80 TO 200 + 60 * COS (A),80 + 60 * SIN (A): NEXT
60 REM HPLOT TO KEEPS THE COLOUR OF THE LAST DOT PLOTTED
70 HCOLOR= 5: HPLOT 120,150: HCOLOR= 1: HPLOT TO 270,150
80 REM SINGLE DOTS IN ODD AND EVEN COLUMNS
90 HCOLOR= 3: FOR X = 120 TO 136 STEP 4: HPLOT X,10: HPLOT X + 1,14: NEXT
100 VTAB 21: PRINT "HI-RES TEST": INVERSE : PRINT "INVERSE";: FLASH : PRINT "FLASH";: NORMAL : PRINT "NORMAL"
110 ONERR GOTO 130
120 HPLOT 280,0
130 PRINT "CAUGHT"
